#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: ai-act-labels.php
msgid "AI Act Image Labels"
msgstr "AI Act Image Labels"

#. Description of the plugin
#: ai-act-labels.php
msgid "Marks AI-generated and AI-modified media as the EU AI Act asks – right in the media library, with the EU's official icons on the site, and an assistant that finds what needs a label."
msgstr "Oznacza media wygenerowane i zmodyfikowane przez AI tak, jak wymaga unijny AI Act – bezpośrednio w bibliotece mediów, z oficjalnymi ikonami UE na witrynie i asystentem, który znajduje to, co wymaga oznaczenia."

#. Author of the plugin
#: ai-act-labels.php
msgid "engenty"
msgstr "engenty"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: ai-act-labels.php
msgid "https://engenty.ai"
msgstr "https://engenty.ai"

